<title>USA: TENNIS-OKLAHOMA CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-OKLAHOMA CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Oklahoma 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $164,250 IGA Tennis Classic on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 5-Jennifer Capriati 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>3-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Sandra Cacic (U.S.) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>4-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Pam Shriver (U.S.) 7-5 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Francesca Lubiana (Italy) beat 2-Amanda Coetzer (South</p>
<p>Africa) 6-0 6-4</p>
</text>
